  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>For option (i),</p><p>Let&nbsp; <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>M</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>M</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mo>.</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Also,&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>M</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mo>.</mo><mi>cost&#160;</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>M</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>M</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math> &nbsp; &nbsp; (so <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>M</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math> can be zero)</p><p>For option (ii),</p><p>Let,&nbsp;&nbsp; <math><mi>k</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now,&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, as&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>f</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Also,&nbsp;&nbsp;<math><mi>k</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>f</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0,1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math><mo>&#8658;&#160;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>k</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>k</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math> &nbsp; &nbsp; (so <math> <mrow> <mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo> </mrow> </math> can be zero)</p><p>For option (iii),</p><p>Let&nbsp; <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mi>si</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>&#39;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8704;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> &nbsp; &nbsp;(as <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#183;</mo><mtext>sin&#160;x</mtext></math>&nbsp;, is less than 1)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> is strictly increasing function.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>1</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#8704;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Also,&nbsp; <math><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>, (so <math> <mrow> <mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo> </mrow> </math> is, never zero)</p><p>For option (iv),</p><p>Let, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mo>.</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>T</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#8704;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>f</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math> &nbsp; &nbsp; (so <math> <mrow> <mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo> </mrow> </math> can not be zero)</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"
  }
}